{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/10928","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/10928/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/10928/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/10928/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core/issues/10928","id":2292546595,"node_id":"I_kwDOCCum186IpXwj","number":10928,"title":"toggle event throws error on details element","user":{"login":"Lenni009","id":91371655,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMzcxNjU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91371655?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenni009","html_url":"https://github.com/Lenni009","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenni009/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenni009/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenni009/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenni009/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenni009/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenni009/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenni009/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenni009/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lenni009/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":962500786,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NjI1MDA3ODY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/labels/:lady_beetle:%20%20bug","name":":lady_beetle:  bug","color":"fcba03","default":false,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":1971465428,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTcxNDY1NDI4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/labels/scope:%20types","name":"scope: types","color":"0366d6","default":false,"description":""},{"id":2557600955,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNTU3NjAwOTU1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/labels/:hammer:%20p3-minor-bug","name":":hammer: p3-minor-bug","color":"999AE7","default":false,"description":"Priority 3: this fixes a bug, but is an edge case that only affects very specific usage."}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-05-12T21:10:35Z","updated_at":"2024-06-05T00:20:19Z","closed_at":"2024-05-20T11:42:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Description\r\n\r\nWhen putting an `@toggle` event handler on a `<details>` element, the type checking fails with this error:\r\n\r\n```\r\nsrc/App.vue:6:13 - error TS2322: Type '() => void' is not assignable to type 'Event'.\r\n\r\n<details @toggle=\"sayHi\">\r\n\r\nnode_modules/@vue/runtime-dom/dist/runtime-dom.d.ts:444:5\r\nonToggle?: Event;\r\n\r\nThe expected type comes from property 'onToggle' which is declared here on type 'DetailsHTMLAttributes & ReservedProps & Record<string, unknown>'\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Expected Behaviour\r\n\r\nSince `toggle` is a standard DOM event, I want to be able to hook up an event listener to that event.\r\n\r\nIt works in the `1.x` versions of `vue-tsc`, and also works when Typescript isn't used.\r\n\r\n## Workaround\r\n\r\nWhen using the old `element.addEventListener('toggle', () => {});` syntax, there is no error.\r\n\r\n## Reproduction\r\n\r\nMinimal reproduction: https://github.com/Lenni009/vue-details-toggle-event-issue","closed_by":{"login":"haoqunjiang","id":3277634,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzc2MzQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3277634?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/haoqunjiang","html_url":"https://github.com/haoqunjiang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/haoqunjiang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/